WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
They took you away openly

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Who did he report to?

3
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Does he have this right?

4
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,980
Residential area

5
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:07,980
where are you

6
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:08,980
I have something to look for you

7
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:11,060
you are there

8
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,060
Captain Han

9
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:13,060
That's our Captain Lu

10
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:14,060
You guys wait here

11
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:15,060
I asked him for you today

12
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,060
I'll take you away tomorrow

13
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:18,510
Keep blowing

14
00:00:18,510 --> 00:00:19,830
Who else can come to you?

15
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:20,960
Our captain has a lot of things to do every day

16
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:21,960
How is it possible to get to a place like this?

17
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:22,960
Looking for someone

18
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:23,960
Are you finished?

19
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:24,960
If you don't go, someone else will

20
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:25,960
Did we tell you to handle the situation?

21
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:26,960
I'm afraid you'll be cheated

22
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:27,960
Captain Lu, who is that?

23
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:28,960
Who is not Baba Di?

24
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:29,960
Go to him and find him

25
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:30,960
You guys are stupid

26
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:31,960
No brain at all

27
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,180
Miss Han

28
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:37,420
what are you doing here

29
00:00:38,420 --> 00:00:39,420
I want to ask you for someone

30
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:40,420
These twenty-one

31
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:41,420
I'll take it back to my base

32
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:42,420
You take a holiday

33
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:45,420
If they come with you voluntarily, they can leave.

34
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,420
However, the supplies cannot be taken away.
